// GENERATED ENTITY BACKUP MAP - do not edit by hand
// Generated by scripts/build.py from common/config/entity_names.json.
// =============================================================================
// Maps espcontrol.backup v2 envelope fields onto ESPHome entities. Entities are
// identified by NAME, not object_id: web_server matches names first and logs
// object_id URLs as deprecated (removal in 2026.7.0).
//
// `derived` marks a field whose value is not a plain 1:1 entity read/write - it
// has a hand-written rule in config_api.h. The build.py validator requires the
// two to stay in step.
// =============================================================================
